   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ind-texts">
   <div class="ind-t" data-t="0"><h3 class="ind-name" aria-label="Peptides">PEPTIDES</h3><p class="ind-sub">Research · RUO</p></div>
   <div class="ind-t" data-t="1"><h3 class="ind-name" aria-label="Botanicals">BOTANICALS</h3><p class="ind-sub">Hemp · Botanical extracts</p></div>
   <div class="ind-t" data-t="2"><h3 class="ind-name" aria-label="Kanna">KANNA</h3><p class="ind-sub">Kanna · Clinics &amp; telehealth</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ind-foot">
   <div class="ind-desc">
    <p data-d="0">Our primary specialty. Peptide brands and websites for RUO: identity, compliant stores, processor-ready checkout and back office, from first launch to scale.</p>
