<!-- ============ SERVICES ============ -->
<section class="svc" id="services" aria-labelledby="svcTitle">
 <div class="wrap svc-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow"><svg class="mol-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#mol"/></svg><span>Services</span></p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="svcTitle" data-scramble>Five things we build for brands like yours.</h2>
  <p class="lead rv">Brand identity, compliant websites, processor-ready checkout and back office, with marketing on top when you are ready. Start with the one thing that is stuck, or hand us the whole launch.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="svc-pin" id="svcPin">
  <div class="svc-stage">
   <div class="svc-side">
    <div class="svc-nums" role="tablist" aria-label="Services">
     <button type="button" class="is-on" data-go="0" aria-label="Brand and launch">01</button>
     <button type="button" data-go="1" aria-label="Websites and stores">02</button>
     <button type="button" data-go="2" aria-label="Checkout and payments">03</button>
     <button type="button" data-go="3" aria-label="Back office">04</button>
     <button type="button" data-go="4" aria-label="Marketing add-ons">05</button>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-texts">
     <div class="svc-tx is-on" data-i="0"><h3>Brand &amp; launch</h3><p>Your name, logo, vial labels and store, designed together by one team. A brand buyers trust before they read a word.</p><p class="svc-del">Identity <span>/</span> Labels <span>/</span> Packaging <span>/</span> Launch</p><a class="svc-more" href="/peptide-brand-launch">More on brand launches<svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div>
     <div class="svc-tx" data-i="1"><h3>Websites &amp; stores</h3><p>Compliance-first peptide websites that still sell. Built on platforms that allow you, with a COA on every product and a checkout reviewed line by line.</p><p class="svc-del">Design &amp; copy <span>/</span> Product pages <span>/</span> COA library <span>/</span> Checkout</p><a class="svc-more" href="/peptide-websites">More on peptide websites<svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div>
